=================== 7491c5c
7491c5c Integration (round 2): remove WS-2's temporary D032 relaxations

P2-AR-0023 (WS-2 R3-7) accepted doctor D032 as the sole failure on an
UNPROVISIONED machine in brownfield_adoption_end_to_end,
path_migration_with_rollback_and_memory_rebuild and the 4.1.2 -> current update
chain, until WS-8's harness provisioned the scenario machines. With the harness
merged those machines are provisioned: the relaxations (the
adopted_but_for_unprovisioned_posture helper and the D032 doctor filter) are
removed and the strict assertions apply (ADOPTED_HEALTHY or
ADOPTED_WITH_ACCEPTED_EXCEPTIONS; only D021 may fail after the chain).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>


